  "identifier": "monai-label",
  "name": "MONAI Label",
  "description": "AI-assisted medical image annotation server with active learning. Runs as a lightweight server connecting to clinical viewers (3D Slicer, OHIF, QuPath, CVAT) and reduces manual annotation effort through interactive segmentation (DeepEdit, DeepGrow), SAM2-based prompting, and continuous model refinement as annotators work. Supports radiology, pathology, and endoscopy domains with DICOM and DICOMWeb connectivity. Apache 2.0, 844 stars, v0.8.5 (October 2023). GitHub shows active development through 2025-2026 including SAM2 integration and 3D Slicer plugin updates despite the slow formal release cadence. Part of the Project-MONAI ecosystem.",
